{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料，根据要求完成教学设计。教材内容：八年级上册第二课“网络生活新空间”（节选）。片段1：网络让我们日常生活中的信息传递和交流变得方便迅捷。……沉迷网络，影响学习、工作和生活……片段2：今天，互联网已经成为我们重要的学习工具和交往平台。我们要提高媒介素养，积极利用互联网获取新知、促进沟通、完善自我。相关材料：在“停课不停教、停课不停学”居***，九年级的小王充分利用“云课堂”丰富优秀资源，主动学习，与老师***分享……12岁小学生打赏网络主播，花掉母亲4万元积蓄；13岁少年爱玩网游，经常旷课、逃课……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "27b27202d4d212fece2ddf3d80e9e3156180b6c8a8b41850aee64b904c70f81e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4070, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4327, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 35, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "27b27202d4d212fece2ddf3d80e9e3156180b6c8a8b41850aee64b904c70f81e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.s3.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.309.r009", "ntce.outline.309.r011", "ntce.outline.309.r012"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.zhengzhi.2023a.q35"], "word_count": 257, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "27b27202d4d212fece2ddf3d80e9e3156180b6c8a8b41850aee64b904c70f81e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4070, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4327, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中政治》题（考生回忆版）.csv",